        "Top 10% on a licensing exam",
        "Every citation traced to one launch-day claim: a press release and preprint by authors with a commercial stake. The comparison pool was skewed toward repeat takers. A re-analysis found much weaker results.",
        "Yes: press-release origin, commercial authorship, preprint-only"
