  "title": "Morally Inadmissible Evidence in AI-Assisted Research",
  "label": {
   "tag": "Negative (illustrative)",
   "html": "The evidence may be accurate, and the way it was obtained wrongs the people it came from. Agents make that acquisition faster and harder to see. Detection and marking tools exist only in pieces."
  },
